WEBVTT

00:13:29.763 --> 00:13:35.185
with the thrill of working
with these young people.

00:13:35.227 --> 00:13:37.938
You know, and it had happened
two weeks ago in New Mexico

00:13:37.938 --> 00:13:40.482
with a young woman
who's the public land commissioner,

00:13:40.482 --> 00:13:42.067
also a Latina woman.

00:13:42.609 --> 00:13:44.736
And in Michigan with the attorney general,

00:13:44.778 --> 00:13:46.363
Dana Nessel.

00:13:46.405 --> 00:13:48.282
They are so brave,

00:13:48.323 --> 00:13:52.786
and they so understand
that fossil fuels is what’s killing us.

00:13:52.786 --> 00:13:55.956
And they’re not afraid to stand up

00:13:55.998 --> 00:13:58.667
to the big corporations.

00:13:58.709 --> 00:14:00.043
And it just makes me --